# Build context for the `api` service is the repo root (docker-compose.yml), the
# same as the frontend's. BuildKit prefers this <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the
# root .dockerignore for THIS build only, which is what we need: the root file
# excludes QT_API/ (correct for the frontend image, fatal here - the API builds
# from it), while this build also needs codex/contents/ for the guides seed data.
#
# Secrets are still excluded below, exactly as at the root.

# Production secrets - mounted at runtime by docker-compose, never baked in.
**/appsettings.Production.json
.env

# Runtime data and uploads (server-side only, never built)
**/App_Data/
**/uploads/

# Dependencies and build output - reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# TLS material - Cloudflare terminates TLS, nothing here needs certs
**/ssl/
*.pem
*.key

# Tooling / editor noise
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
**/*.user
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
